                        <div class="acco-item">

                           <h2 class="acco-link">Know everything about our Personal Loan</h2>

                           <div class="acco-body">

                              <p>As a well-informed borrower, you must understand all the aspects of loan, especially Personal Loan. Borrowers may have doubts or misconceptions or seek more information about certain borrowing aspects. Here are answers to the most Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) about the credifycapital Personal Loan.</p>

                              <div class="tab-inner-content emitab">

                                 <!-- Nav tabs -->

                                 <ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="faqtabs">

                                    <li class="nav-item">

                                       <a class="nav-link active" data-toggle="tab" href="#started">Get started</a>

                                    </li>

                                    <li class="nav-item">

                                       <a class="nav-link" data-toggle="tab" href="#details">Loan Details</a>

                                    </li>

                                    <li class="nav-item">

                                       <a class="nav-link" data-toggle="tab" href="#eligibility">Eligibility</a>

                                    </li>

                                 </ul>

                                 <!-- Tab panes -->

                                 <div class="tab-content pt-0" id="faqtabcontent">

                                    <div id="started" class="tab-pane active">

                                       <div class="accordion-new mt-0">

                                          <div class="accordion js-accordion">

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">What are the benefits of a Personal Loan?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>Our <a href="/personal-loan.html">Personal Loan</a> has a range of benefits. Right from a medical emergency, home renovation to higher education and debt consolidation, Personal Loan can be used to meet any financial requirement since it has no spending restrictions. The loan is unsecured and easy to avail. Other benefits include competitive interest rates, flexible tenure options, sizable loan amounts, and a 100% digital process.</p>

                                                </div>

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">How can I apply for a Personal Loan?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>Applying for a Personal Loan with credifycapital is very easy and quick. All you have to do is meet the eligibility criteria, submit the required documents mentioned in the <a href="/personal-loan-eligibility-and-documents.html">Personal Loan document list</a>, and fill out an <a href="/apply.html">easy online application form</a>. </p>

                                                </div>

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">Can I get an instant approval for a Personal Loan?

                                                </div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>Yes, you can get instant approval for a credifycapital Personal Loan. Do note that this benefit is only available to applicants who meet all the <a href="/personal-loan-eligibility-and-documents.html">Personal Loan eligibility criteria</a>.</p>

                                                </div>

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">How do I get the best interest rate for a Personal Loan?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>There are many factors that drive the interest rate for a Personal Loan. Some of the tips to have the best interest rate on loan are as follows:</p>

                                                   <ul class="list">

                                                      <li>Meet all the eligibility criteria and submit the required documents</li>

                                                      <li>Maintain a high Credit Score</li>

                                                      <li>Have a good repayment track record and credit history</li>

                                                      <li>Maintain employment stability and have a steady income</li>

                                                   </ul>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">Are there any advantages of unsecured Personal Loans?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>Below are some of the advantages of <a href="/unsecured-personal-loan.html">unsecured personal loan</a> over other loans : </p>

                                                   <ul class="list">

                                                      <li>No need of collateral</li>

                                                      <li>Quick funding time</li>

                                                      <li>Flexibility in terms of use</li>

                                                      <li>Low interest rate</li>

                                                      <li>Flexible loan tenure</li>

                                                   </ul>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                          </div>

                                          <!-- end of accordion -->

                                       </div>

                                    </div>

                                    <div id="details" class="tab-pane fade">

                                       <div class="accordion-new mt-0">

                                          <div class="accordion js-accordion">

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">What are the minimum and maximum loan amounts?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>The minimum loan amount you can avail of is 1 Lakh, whereas the maximum loan amount is 50 Lakh.</p>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">What are the minimum and maximum loan tenures?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>The minimum loan tenure for a credifycapital Personal Loan is one year, whereas the maximum tenure is Seven years.</p>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">What are the fees, charges, and interest rates applicable on a Personal Loan?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>The interest rate on credifycapital's Personal Loan starts at just 9.99%* p.a. Also, you will have to pay a processing fee of up to 3% of the sanction amount plus applicable taxes to process the loan application. You can visit our dedicated webpage for a clear breakup of applicable <a href="/personal-loan-interest-rates-and-charges.html">interest rates &amp; charges</a>.</p>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">Is there any penalty for foreclosing the loan?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>No, there is no additional charge or penalty for foreclosing your loan before the tenure as long as you make the payments with your own funds.</p>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">Which documents do I need to submit to get a Personal Loan?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>To get a credifycapital's Personal Loan, you only need to submit some basic documents such as KYC documents, address proofs, income documents, etc. The full list of <a href="/personal-loan-eligibility-and-documents.html">Personal Loan required documents</a> is available online.</p>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                          </div>

                                       </div>

                                    </div>

                                    <div id="eligibility" class="tab-pane fade">

                                       <div class="accordion-new mt-0">

                                          <div class="accordion js-accordion">

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">How do I qualify for the Personal Loan?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>To qualify for a Personal Loan, you must meet all the eligibility terms related to age, work experience, employment, monthly salary, and citizenship. </p>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">What type of company do I need to work for to get a Personal Loan?</div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>You must have a full-time job at a central and state government, PSU, MNC, Listed, Unlisted Public Ltd., Private Limited Company, LLP, or companies listed internally to get a credifycapital's Personal Loan.</p>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">What are the terms related to job continuity applicable on the loan?

                                                </div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>To get approved for the loan, you must have at least 1 year of work experience overall with at least 1 month of job stability at your current company.</p>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                             <div class="accordion-item js-accordion-item">

                                                <div class="accordion-header js-accordion-header">Can self-employed individuals get a credifycapital Personal Loan?

                                                </div>

                                                <div class="accordion-body js-accordion-body">

                                                   <p>No, self-employed individuals cannot get a Personal Loan from credifycapital. Only salaried employees can get a Personal Loan. If you are a self-employed professional, you can apply for a <a href="/professional-loan.html">Professional Loan</a> from credifycapital, and business owners can apply for a <a href="/business-loan.html"></a>Business Loan.</p>

                                                   <p style="text-align: right;margin-top: 30px;"><strong>*T&amp;C Apply</strong></p>

                                                </div>

                                                <!-- end of accordion body -->

                                             </div>

                                          </div>

